{"id":"ff00e4aa0ef74db8","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion.md","title":"包含 Fermat 检查的满阶素性判据","display":"thm-full-order-primality-criterion — 包含 Fermat 检查的满阶素性判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion","aliases":["73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion"],"display":"thm-full-order-primality-criterion — 包含 Fermat 检查的满阶素性判据","depends_on":["[[73-df-modular-multiplicative-order]]","[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.5, print pp. 519–520; PDF pp. 541–542; local repair adds the omitted a^(n-1)=1 check","source_status":"source-algorithm-compared; locally proved corrected soundness criterion","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-full-order-primality-criterion — 包含 Fermat 检查的满阶素性判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4307a2772edc1a3b\" href=\"?note=4307a2772edc1a3b\" title=\"73-df-modular-multiplicative-order\">73-df-modular-multiplicative-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"498d8afd65d4a6ee\" href=\"?note=498d8afd65d4a6ee\" title=\"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages\">73-df-primes-and-composites-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.5, print pp. 519–520; PDF pp. 541–542; local repair adds the omitted a^(n-1)=1 check"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-algorithm-compared; locally proved corrected soundness criterion"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>；量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 的素因子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)=1\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\n((\\operatorname{Prime}(q)\\land q\\mid n-1)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(qe=n-1\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)\\ne1))\\right]\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Prime}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)=1\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\n((\\operatorname{Prime}(q)\\land q\\mid n-1)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(qe=n-1\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)\\ne1))\\right]\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Prime}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一条件使 a 为单位且其阶 d 整除 n−1。若 d&lt;n−1，商 (n−1)/d 有素因子 q，则 d 整除 (n−1)/q，与第二条件矛盾。故 d=n−1，n−1 个非零剩余类全是 a 的幂、全为单位；若 n 合数，其真因子却不是单位，矛盾。n=2 时素因子量化为空，但第一条件正确。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-modular-multiplicative-order","status":"resolved","id":"4307a2772edc1a3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-modular-multiplicative-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages","status":"resolved","id":"498d8afd65d4a6ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"n-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\left[\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)=1\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\n((\\operatorname{Prime}(q)\\land q\\mid n-1)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(qe=n-1\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)\\ne1))\\right]\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Prime}(n).","display":true}],"bytes":1575,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion]]"},{"id":"4723b54e4035a6fb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8dd111dd979ae61f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion|包含 Fermat 检查的满阶素性判据]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"d182dd0cac33ba74","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4307a2772edc1a3b","498d8afd65d4a6ee"]}